<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDES LEAD SWISS 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDES LEAD SWISS 2-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LULEA, Sweden 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden won the doubles match in the Davis Cup world group first round tie against Switzerland on Saturday to put them 2-1 ahead.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Nicklas Kulti/Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Marc Rosset/Lorenzo Manta (Switzerland) 5-7 6-4 6-3 5-7 6-4</p>
</text>
